auto-color.customThemes.markdownDescription:
Your own named themes, usable via `auto-color.theme` = `custom` and `auto-color.customTheme`. Colors are hex or color names. Can live in user settings or be shared in the repo's `.vscode/settings.json`.

```json
"auto-color.customThemes": {
  "Brand": { "title": "#0b3d91", "activity": "#1252c9", "status": "#d81b60", "kind": "dark" }
}
```
